      "side": 1,
      "message": "Was device name previously part of the directory name, or does this commit change it? I\u0027m asking because there was some work recently focused on getting rid of device-specific subdirectories in dexpreopt intermediate files. If this commit doesn\u0027t change things, it\u0027s ok. Otherwise we need to dig a bit deeper.",
